  'home.lead': 'Türkiye’s first lunar spacecraft, AYAP-1, will end its mission with a controlled impact on the Moon. This site shows whether the impact could be seen from Earth, from where, and with what equipment, based on open data and reproducible calculations.',
  'home.cta_explore': 'Explore the scenarios', 'home.cta_see': 'What could I see?', 'home.cta_live': 'Live page',
