  'ex.kicker': 'Explore', 'ex.title': 'What happens if the impact is here, or then?',
  'ex.lead': 'The mission team has not yet announced the impact site or time. The study therefore defines 11 test points that represent different conditions, and computes for each how the Moon looks, who on Earth can see it, and how likely the flash is to be recorded.',
  'ex.note_hyp': 'These points are hypothetical and are not official AYAP-1 targets. Probabilities assume the spacecraft reaches its planned final trajectory.',
